# --- Secrets -----------------------------------------------------------------
# The previous list named only .env and .env.local, so .env.production,
# .env.staging and friends were all committable. Ignore the whole family and
# re-admit the placeholder templates explicitly.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example

